{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S10—S11解释为什么不能只凭舍不得就回去，以及为什么先把眼下的日子过稳些时，不如Y直白、具体。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点词有明显的视觉层级，感受又按音乐段落出现，观众不必同时消化一大堆短词，能够边听边抓住叙事和音乐的对应关系。它对情绪的描写也更细腻，能让人感到从离开后的空落、反复拉扯，到重新面对生活的过程是连续的。Y的因果解释有几处更直白，但右侧短词堆叠且缺少逐段时序，容易把细腻的情绪和音乐变化压缩成标签。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3c88bdf7-c14e-4687-ba9c-fc54f74f0b71", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T024140304901Z", "elapsed_seconds": 54.406, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T02:42:34.719879+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "057472b0caab8c51f9b23d198e3f52275ff8069d895696e38a4a2b9d146e0242", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa238